    <path class="d-b" d="M6 24 C6 19 9 17 14 17 H24 C26 15 27 12 28 10 C29 8 32 8 33 10 L35 12 L33 14 L30 14 C30 17 29 20 28 22 C28 25 26 26 24 26 H10 C7 26 6 25 6 24 Z"/>
